<title>USA: Jackson, Wis., won by Bankers Bank.</title>
<headline>Jackson, Wis., won by Bankers Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Bank said it won $2 million of Jackson, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, with a true interest cost of 4.89 percent.</p>
</text>
